<figure class="placement-figure wide" data-placement-reads aria-labelledby="placement-reads-title">
  <figcaption id="placement-reads-title"><span>Figure 4</span> <strong>A nearby value needs a history contract</strong></figcaption>
  <div class="placement-panel">
    <div class="placement-options"><label>Read requirement <select data-contract><option value="current">Current authoritative state</option><option value="after">Must include the acknowledged change</option><option value="past">Permitted history before the change</option></select></label></div>
    <div class="placement-read-grid">
      <div class="placement-replica"><b>West · leader</b><span>U durable and committed</span><strong>22.00 applied</strong><small>Successful reply already sent</small></div>
      <div class="placement-replica"><b>East · voter</b><span>U durable</span><strong>Application not established</strong><small>Supplied the other acknowledgement</small></div>
      <div class="placement-replica is-active"><b>North · nearby copy</b><span>U not yet applied</span><strong>20.00 applied</strong><small>Available to the North application</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="placement-read-arrow" data-read-arrow data-live>North’s 20.00 → needs authority and freshness evidence</div>
    <p class="placement-explanation" data-explanation data-live aria-live="polite">Proximity is not proof of current state. Use the engine’s qualified authority path; remote communication may be needed.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="placement-caption">A separate illustrative state after the P7 price change, with West and East forming the durable majority. Durable, applied and safe to read are different tests. Order 103 still has agreed total 29.00; this catalogue illustration does not alter stock.</p>
  <details><summary>Read requirements as text</summary><ul><li>Current authoritative state: the nearby 20.00 alone supplies no proof of freshness or authority.</li><li>Include the acknowledged change: North must first qualify a target and snapshot that include applied U, or route elsewhere or return unavailable under the chosen contract.</li><li>Permitted history before U: 20.00 can be the right answer if the engine proves the requested history safe to serve. It remains unsuitable as authority for a new stock decrement.</li></ul></details>
</figure>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-placement-reads]').forEach(root=>{
    const contract=root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-contract]')!;
    const draw=()=>{
      const text={current:['North’s 20.00 → needs authority and freshness evidence','Proximity is not proof of current state. Use the engine’s qualified authority path; remote communication may be needed.'],after:['North’s 20.00 → does not include applied U','Wait for a qualified applied history before taking the snapshot, route to a qualified target, or return unavailable. Receiving U alone is insufficient.'],past:['North’s 20.00 → potentially valid for the permitted past','The engine must establish that the requested historical state is safe to serve. This permission to read the past does not authorise a new purchase against old stock.']}[contract.value]!;
      root.querySelector('[data-read-arrow]')!.textContent=text[0];root.querySelector('[data-explanation]')!.textContent=text[1];
    };contract.addEventListener('change',draw);draw();
  });
</script>
